OL,3,GNEWSAMum dies after trying to rescue
OL,4,Asons swept away at sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British mum has died after attempting
OL,7,Fto rescue her two sons when they were
OL,8,Fswept away while snorkelling in the
OL,9,FBahamas.
OL,11,FThe Royal Bahamas Police Force said
OL,12,Fofficers on the island of Bimini
OL,13,Flaunched an investigation into the
OL,14,Fsudden death of a 36-year-old British
OL,15,Fwoman on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
